<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>BinaryTree on Ruoke Zhang</title><link>/categories/binarytree/</link><description>Recent content in BinaryTree on Ruoke Zhang</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 04 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="/categories/binarytree/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>二叉树 dfs</title><link>/post/leetcode/binarytree/dfs/</link><pubDate>Tue, 04 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>/post/leetcode/binarytree/dfs/</guid><description>&lt;p>二叉树回溯与普通回溯的区别在于，不能在边界条件把答案加入res. 因为一个leaf，对它的两个子节点判断root==null, 则会把答案加进 res两次。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>